  "name": "Kitchen Sink Cookies",
  "subtitle": "Chewy cookies with oats, chocolate, chips, and pecans",
  "description": "A generous batch of soft-centered cookies combining brown sugar, oats, assorted baking chips, and chopped pecans.",
